2026-10-13T11:15:03.9649628Z options:
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9649951Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9650442Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9650948Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9651423Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9651795Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9652669Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9653212Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9653751Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9654245Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9654689Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9655179Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9655676Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9656101Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9656736Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9657160Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9657554Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9657951Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9658333Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9658705Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9659082Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9659427Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9659778Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9660235Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9660655Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9661038Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9661423Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
