2026-10-13T11:15:03.9663181Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9663553Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9663968Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
