2026-10-13T11:15:03.9667949Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9668264Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9668600Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9668943Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9669318Z                         io-direct to disable).
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9669706Z   --dry-run             print the computed profile and the forwarded command
2026-10-13T11:15:03.9670106Z                         without launching the script.
