2026-10-13T11:15:04.0916719Z options:
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0917220Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0917991Z   --version             show program's version number and exit
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0918911Z   --config FILE         load thresholds/matrix from a JSON or YAML file (YAML
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0919613Z                         needs PyYAML)
