2026-10-13T11:15:04.0920515Z                         benchmark)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0920700Z 
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0920795Z bandwidth matrix:
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0921116Z   --shard-sizes LIST    comma-separated shard sizes, e.g. '180k,1m'
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0921552Z   --workers LIST        comma-separated worker counts, e.g. '1,16'
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0922003Z   --engines LIST        comma-separated IO engines, subset of 'psync,aio'
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0922662Z                         (default psync)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0923155Z   --modes LIST          comma-separated phases to run per combo: subset of
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0923599Z                         'dump,read,mix' (default all; mix = read-heavy
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0923943Z                         1:rw_ratio)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0924323Z   --threshold GB        minimum best aggregate bandwidth in GB/s (default 8.0)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0924773Z   --block-number N      blocks per dump/load sweep
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0925121Z   --dump-epochs N       dump sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0925450Z   --load-epochs N       load sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0925848Z   --mixed-epochs N      read-heavy mixed sweeps per combo (1 dump + rw_ratio
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0926253Z                         loads each)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0926608Z   --rw-ratio N          reads per write in the mixed phase (read-heavy; 0
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0927002Z                         disables mixed, default 4)
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0927368Z   --quick               halve dump/load/mixed epochs for a faster run
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0927809Z   --skip-bandwidth      skip the (slow) bandwidth benchmark entirely
2026-10-13T11:15:04.0928092Z 
